<title>UK: SOCCER-TERRY VENABLES FACTFILE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TERRY VENABLES FACTFILE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is factfile on Terry Venables, confirmed on Tuesday as Australia's new coach:</p>
<p>Aug 1960 - Signed professional with West Ham</p>
<p>Oct 1964 - Capped for England</p>
<p>Jun 1976 - Appointed Crystal Palace manager</p>
<p>May 1984 - Appointed Barcelona manager</p>
<p>Sep 1987 - Dismissed by Barcelona</p>
<p>Oct 1987 - Appointed Tottenham Hotspur manager</p>
<p>Jul 1991 - Becomes Chief Executive of Tottenham</p>
<p>Jun 1993 - Dismissed as Chief Executive of Tottenham</p>
<p>Jan 1994 - Appointed England coach</p>
<p>Jul 1996 - Steers England to European Championship</p>
<p>		semifinals</p>
<p>Aug 1996 - Takes over as Director of Football at</p>
<p>		Portsmouth</p>
<p>Nov 1996 - Named as new coach to Australian</p>
<p>		National side</p>
</text>
